{"id":903,"date":"2020-09-01T14:27:36","date_gmt":"2020-09-01T14:27:36","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/wwwtest.rimac-automobili.com\/?post_type=development&#038;p=903"},"modified":"2020-11-11T09:49:36","modified_gmt":"2020-11-11T09:49:36","slug":"aerodynamics","status":"publish","type":"development","link":"https:\/\/www.rimac-automobili.com\/development\/aerodynamics\/","title":{"rendered":"Aerodynamics"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Four surface and underbody active aerodynamic components work in harmony to manipulate airflow giving The C_Two unmatched aero performance and enhanced efficiency. <\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Everything from the active front splitter and intelligent underbody air flaps to the adaptable air brake is designed, developed and tested to perfection in-house, the Rimac way.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\r\n<!-- DEVELOPMENT PHASE -->\r\n<section\r\n        class=\"o-section c-development-phase\r\n                        \">\r\n    <div class=\"o-container--narrow\">\r\n        <div class=\"c-development-phase__inner\">\r\n\t\t\t                <!-- NUMBER WRAPPER -->\r\n                <div class=\"c-development-phase__number-wrapper\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t                        <p class=\"u-a6 c-development-phase__number\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t180                        <\/p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t                        <p class=\"u-a3 c-development-phase__number-title\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tMillion elements                        <\/p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t                        <p class=\"u-b2 c-development-phase__number-subtitle\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCFD simulation models for detailed heat transfer consist of 180 million elements.                        <\/p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t                <\/div>\r\n                <!-- end NUMBER WRAPPER -->\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t                <!-- CONTENT WRAPPER -->\r\n                <div class=\"c-development-phase__content\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t                        <div class=\"c-development-phase__content-media-wrapper\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"c-custom-video-player js-custom-video-player no-poster\">\r\n\r\n        <figure class=\"c-custom-video-player__cover\">\r\n            <figcaption class=\"c-custom-video-player__cover-text\">\r\n                <h4 class=\"u-a1\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t                <\/h4>\r\n                <p class=\"u-b2\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t                <\/p>\r\n            <\/figcaption>\r\n        <\/figure>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"c-custom-video-player__cover-image-wrapper\">\r\n            <p class=\"c-custom-video-player__time\">\r\n                <span class=\"js-time-current\">00:00<\/span>\r\n                \u2014\r\n                <span class=\"js-time-duration\">00:00<\/span>\r\n            <\/p>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t                <video class=\"c-custom-video-player__video js-video-element\"\r\n                       preload=\"metadata\"\r\n                       crossorigin=\"anonymous\"\r\n                       playsinline\r\n                       data-autoplay=\"true\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\tcontrols>\r\n                    <source src=\"https:\/\/web-cdn.rimac-automobili.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/28094219\/computational-fluid-dynamics.mp4\"\r\n                            type=\"video\/mp4\"\/>\r\n                <\/video>\r\n\t\t\t            <!--end video source-->\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n                        <\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t                <\/div>\r\n                <!-- end CONTENT WRAPPER -->\r\n\t\t\t        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n<!-- end DEVELOPMENT PHASE -->\r\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Development has been performed in the loop triangle between:<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Computational fluid dynamics simulations<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul><li>We\u2019ve performed more than 1000 simulations just for the external aerodynamics<\/li><li>Each simulation model consists of over 120 million elements with up to 180 million for the detailed heat transfer models)<\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Wind tunnel testing<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul id=\"block-1650149c-82eb-408a-8ad0-ea7a25230915\"><li>Drag coefficient is correlated within 2.4%<\/li><li>More than 100 components were exchanged during the tests to confirm the correlation and characteristics between the CFD simulation results.<\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1440\" height=\"960\" src=\"https:\/\/web-cdn.rimac-automobili.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/23090228\/image016_aerodynamics.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1522\" srcset=\"https:\/\/web-cdn.rimac-automobili.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/23090228\/image016_aerodynamics.jpg 1440w, https:\/\/web-cdn.rimac-automobili.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/23090228\/image016_aerodynamics-960x640.jpg 960w, https:\/\/web-cdn.rimac-automobili.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/23090228\/image016_aerodynamics-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/web-cdn.rimac-automobili.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/23090228\/image016_aerodynamics-1200x800.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1440px) 100vw, 1440px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Track testing<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul><li>The active aerodynamic system&nbsp;adapts to a chosen driving modes in less than one second<\/li><li>In Track Mode, the air brake actuates in&nbsp;0.3 seconds<\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\r\n<!-- DOUBLE IMAGE MODULE -->\r\n<section class=\"o-section c-development-double-image\">\r\n    <div class=\"o-container--narrow\">\r\n        <div class=\"c-development-double-image__inner\">\r\n\t\t\t                    <!-- IMAGE -->\r\n                    <div class=\"c-development-double-image__image\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t                            <figure class=\"u-media-wrapper\">\r\n                                <i class=\"js-mask-parallax\"\r\n                                   data-ab-interchange='{\"mode\": \"lazy-background\"}'\r\n                                   data-ab-interchange-src=\"[https:\/\/web-cdn.rimac-automobili.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/23090237\/image024_aerodynamics.jpg, large], [https:\/\/web-cdn.rimac-automobili.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/23090237\/image024_aerodynamics.jpg, medium], [https:\/\/web-cdn.rimac-automobili.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/23090237\/image024_aerodynamics.jpg, small]\"\r\n                                ><\/i>\r\n                            <\/figure>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t                    <\/div>\r\n                    <!-- end IMAGE -->\r\n\t\t\t\t\t                    <!-- IMAGE -->\r\n                    <div class=\"c-development-double-image__image\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t                            <figure class=\"u-media-wrapper\">\r\n                                <i class=\"js-mask-parallax\"\r\n                                   data-ab-interchange='{\"mode\": \"lazy-background\"}'\r\n                                   data-ab-interchange-src=\"[https:\/\/web-cdn.rimac-automobili.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/23090234\/image021_aerodynamics.jpg, large], [https:\/\/web-cdn.rimac-automobili.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/23090234\/image021_aerodynamics.jpg, medium], [https:\/\/web-cdn.rimac-automobili.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/23090234\/image021_aerodynamics.jpg, small]\"\r\n                                ><\/i>\r\n                            <\/figure>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t                    <\/div>\r\n                    <!-- end IMAGE -->\r\n\t\t\t\t\t        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n<!-- end DOUBLE IMAGE MODULE -->\r\n\n\n\r\n<!-- DEVELOPMENT PHASE -->\r\n<section\r\n        class=\"o-section c-development-phase\r\n                        \">\r\n    <div class=\"o-container--narrow\">\r\n        <div class=\"c-development-phase__inner\">\r\n\t\t\t                <!-- NUMBER WRAPPER -->\r\n                <div class=\"c-development-phase__number-wrapper\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t                        <p class=\"u-a6 c-development-phase__number\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t34%                        <\/p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t                        <p class=\"u-a3 c-development-phase__number-title\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAerodynamic efficiency improvement                        <\/p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t                        <p class=\"u-b2 c-development-phase__number-subtitle\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFrom the initial C_Two concept to the validation prototype, as a result of continuous optimisation, aerodynamic efficiency has been improved by 34%                        <\/p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t                <\/div>\r\n                <!-- end NUMBER WRAPPER -->\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t                <!-- CONTENT WRAPPER -->\r\n                <div class=\"c-development-phase__content\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t                        <div class=\"c-development-phase__content-media-wrapper\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/web-cdn.rimac-automobili.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/23090231\/image017_aerodynamics.jpg\"\r\n                                     alt=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                        <\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t                <\/div>\r\n                <!-- end CONTENT WRAPPER -->\r\n\t\t\t        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n<!-- end DEVELOPMENT PHASE -->\r\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1440\" height=\"959\" src=\"https:\/\/web-cdn.rimac-automobili.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/23090220\/image001_aerodynamics.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1520\" srcset=\"https:\/\/web-cdn.rimac-automobili.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/23090220\/image001_aerodynamics.jpg 1440w, https:\/\/web-cdn.rimac-automobili.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/23090220\/image001_aerodynamics-960x639.jpg 960w, https:\/\/web-cdn.rimac-automobili.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/23090220\/image001_aerodynamics-768x511.jpg 768w, https:\/\/web-cdn.rimac-automobili.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/23090220\/image001_aerodynamics-1200x799.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1440px) 100vw, 1440px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">C_Two aerodynamic profile variations:<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul><li>In Range Mode drag is reduced by 17.5% when compared to the Track Mode.&nbsp;<\/li><li>Shifting from Range to Track Mode increases downforce by 326%&nbsp;<\/li><li>High speed configuration&nbsp;(DRS) reduces drag coefficient by 10%&nbsp;&nbsp;while keeping balanced downforce.&nbsp;<\/li><li>The fully extended rear wing increases&nbsp;rear radiator mass flow&nbsp;by 7.7%&nbsp;<\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1705\" src=\"https:\/\/web-cdn.rimac-automobili.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/08090808\/2880x1918-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2225\" srcset=\"https:\/\/web-cdn.rimac-automobili.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/08090808\/2880x1918-scaled.jpg 2560w, https:\/\/web-cdn.rimac-automobili.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/08090808\/2880x1918-600x400.jpg 600w, https:\/\/web-cdn.rimac-automobili.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/08090808\/2880x1918-1248x831.jpg 1248w, https:\/\/web-cdn.rimac-automobili.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/08090808\/2880x1918-768x511.jpg 768w, https:\/\/web-cdn.rimac-automobili.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/08090808\/2880x1918-1536x1023.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/web-cdn.rimac-automobili.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/08090808\/2880x1918-2048x1364.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/web-cdn.rimac-automobili.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/08090808\/2880x1918-1024x682.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>C_Two has the largest differentiation on drag and downforce coefficients which means it\u2019s able to meet Range and Track performance targets with a simple driving mode change.<\/p>\n\n\n\r\n<!-- NEXT STEPS -->\r\n<section class=\"o-section c-next-steps\">\r\n    <div class=\"c-next-steps__inner\">\r\n        <p class=\"u-b3 u-uppercase\">\r\n\t\t\tNext steps:        <\/p>\r\n\r\n        <h4 class=\"u-a3\">\r\n\t\t\tTesting and optimizing active aerodynamic control logic.        <\/h4>\r\n\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/section>\r\n<!-- end NEXT STEPS -->\r\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n","protected":false},"parent":0,"template":"","acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v19.14 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Aerodynamics - Rimac Automobili<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/www.rimac-automobili.com\/development\/aerodynamics\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Aerodynamics - Rimac Automobili\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Four surface and underbody active aerodynamic components work in harmony to manipulate airflow giving The C_Two unmatched aero performance and enhanced efficiency. Everything from the active front splitter and intelligent underbody air flaps to the adaptable air brake is designed, developed and tested to perfection in-house, the Rimac way.&nbsp;&nbsp; Development has been performed in the [&hellip;]\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/www.rimac-automobili.com\/development\/aerodynamics\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Rimac Automobili\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2020-11-11T09:49:36+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/www.rimac-automobili.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/09\/image016_aerodynamics.jpg\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" \/>\n<script type=\"application\/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@co